We provide training to agents as part of the change management process, ensuring a smooth transition to the new solution. Our company has a strong commitment to sustainability, relying on green hosting providers, using renewable energy sources, and implementing digital sobriety practices such as int8/int4 model quantization, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle.

We believe our solution meets the requirements and constraints of the call for tenders, providing a high level of availability, relevance, and security while minimizing environmental impact. Our team is committed to delivering a cost-competitive solution that complies with regulatory requirements, ensuring explainability, transparency, and data protection. We look forward to the opportunity to discuss our proposal in further detail.
